      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>G-Unity seems to be filled with thematic goodies rather than outright mechanical dominance.&nbsp; Blowing up an Electro-Pulse Explosive or one of Voss&#39;s ships is cool thematically rather than a consistent mechanical benefit.&nbsp; Unity blowing up villain Devices is something fans speculated about for a month or two when she was revealed in the Kickstarter.&nbsp; If it doesn&#39;t sound terribly fun to you, then I recommend playing her exclusively against villains with Devices or doing your best to keep her alive (which is a game in and of itself).<br /><br />I&#39;d rather have a specialized, thematically interesting incapacitated power than an innate power that just zaps 4-18 HP targets for free.</p>",
      "actions_summary": [
