      "cooked": "<p>Played with unity again last night. Man, if she can manage to get those bots out then she gets ridobnkullous. I got the cube thing that lets her summon two bots and I got swiftbot on the first turn.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Had 7 bots out by the end of the game. It was beautiful&nbsp;</p>",
