      "name": "Chaosmancer",
      "username": "Chaosmancer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-13T19:46:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have you beat, my last game with Unity I used almost every pillar and ended the game with 9 bots (2 raptors, 2 bees, Swift, Champion, platform, turret... and something else, maybe a second platform) I'd have had more but Omnitron used his fletchettes and I had to sacrifice Stealth bot to keep my raptors. Needless to say Unity was ripping apart poor Omnitron without even batting an eye.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I did have a question though. Flash Forge allows you to search for X golems or equipment and allows you to play it, that means you could look for whatever you want correct? Because I used it to get to construction pillars out (I started with a hand compromised almost solely of golems) and that felt like it was an incredibly powerful card</p>",
      "post_number": 14,
      "post_type": 1,
