      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-13T22:21:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Flash Forge is incredibly powerful, but it doesn't put them directly into play, which is how I'm reading your statement.&nbsp; It puts them into your hand.&nbsp; Unless you have Swift Bot, that means you have to wait a turn before you start the Construction Pylon madness.&nbsp; Incidentally, getting to broken with Unity often involves getting and keeping Swift Bot.</p>",
